:: Flats Hookah
<<effects>>

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<set _noWake to true>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "hookah">>
<<else>>
	<<if $hookah_state is 3>>
		<<if $whitney_home_stage gte 3 and (C.npc.Whitney.state is "active" or C.npc.Whitney.state is "rescued") and not $weekly.whitneyHookah and $rng gte 81>>
			<<set $weekly.whitneyHookah to 1>>
			<<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
			You're about to open the door when it bangs open without a knock. <span class="pink">It's Whitney.</span> Two of <<his>> friends pile in behind <<him>>, filling your parlour with noise.
			<br><br>
			<<set $whitney_hookah_visit to ($whitney_hookah_visit or 0) + 1>>
			<<if $whitney_hookah_visit is 1>>
				Whitney looks the place over like <<he>> owns it, then settles <<his>> eye on you.
				<br><br>
				"So this is the den everyone's been yammering about," <<he>> says. <<if C.npc.Whitney.dom gte 20>>"Should've known it was my slut running the show."<<else>>"Should've known it was yours."<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> drops onto a cushion by the hookah and sprawls out. <<His>> friends crowd in around the pipe.
				<br><br>
				"We're staying a while," <<he>> says, making <<himself>> comfortable. "Get it going."
			<<else>>
				Whitney doesn't bother looking the place over this time, stomping inside with two of <<his>> friends in tow. <<He>> heads straight for the same cushion <<he>> sat in last time and drops onto it casually.
				<br><br>
				"Miss me?" <<he>> asks. <<His>> friends sprawl out around the pipe.
				<br><br>
				"You know the drill," <<he>> says with a grin. "Get it going, slut."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Let them in for free|Flats Hookah Whitney Free]]>><<glove>><<gdom>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Make them pay|Flats Hookah Whitney Pay]]>><<ldom>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			You are in your hookah parlour. The hookah itself sits in the centre, surrounded by cushions.
			<br><br>

			<<hookah_juice>>

			<<if $hookah.juice gte 1>>
				<<if $daily.hookah is 1>>
					<span class="red">You were warned that smoking for more than an hour a day could be dangerous.</span>
					<br>
					<<rng 2>>
					<<if $rng is 2>>
						<<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[Partake anyway (1:00)|Flats Hookah Smoke]]>><<set $hookah.juice -= 1>><<hallucinogen 60>><</link>>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[Partake anyway (1:00)|Flats Hookah Smoke Danger]]>><<set $hookah.juice -= 1>><<hallucinogen 60>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					<<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[Partake (1:00)|Flats Hookah Smoke]]>><<set $hookah.juice -= 1>><<set $daily.hookah to 1>><<hallucinogen 60>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
				<<if $exposed lte 0>>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Entice customers (1:00)|Flats Hookah Work]]>><<set $hookah.juice -= 1>><<hallucinogen 60>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<getouticon>> <<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $hookah_state is 2>>
		You are in your hookah parlour. The hookah itself lies broken on the floor, but the smell of incense remains.
		<br><br>

		<<choreicon "sweep">><<link [[Clean (3:00)|Flats Hookah Clean]]>><<set $hookah_state to 3>><<pass 180>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $hookah_state is undefined>>
		<<set $hookah_state to 1>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>>
		You push open the door, and peer inside. Five people lie on velvet cushions around a hookah pipe. The smell is intoxicating.
		<br><br>
		A <<person1>><<person>> enters from an adjoining room, carrying a bowl and pair of tongs. <<He>> lifts a squirming something from the vessel, and places it in the hookah pipe.
		<br><br>
		"Aha," <<he>> says, noticing you. You hear a jingle as <<he>> turns. A pair of tiny spectacles sits on the end of <<his>> nose. "Another visitor. It's <<printprice 5000>> for an hour on the hookah."
		<br><br>
		"No two people have the same experience," <<he>> adds, as if predicting a question. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
		<<if playerBellyVisible()>>
			<<He>> looks down at your <<bellyDescription "pc">>. "Don't worry, it's completely safe. For your baby, I mean."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="gold">You've discovered the hookah parlour.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<saveNPC 0 "hookah">>
		<<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "hookah">><<person1>>
		The hookah parlour isn't quite where you remember it, but you catch a whiff of the familiar incense, which helps track it down. The front door is open, and a purple light glows within. You push it ajar, and peer inside.
		<br><br>
		<<if $rng gte 81>>
			The spectacled hookah <<hookah_master>> sits on one of the cushions <<himself>>, reading a newspaper.
		<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
			The spectacled hookah <<hookah_master>> kneels in front of a cabinet and rummages within.
		<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
			The spectacled hookah <<hookah_master>> is polishing the pipe.
		<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
			The spectacled hookah <<hookah_master>> leans on a window and watches <<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>the rain.<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>the snow.<<else>>the street below.<</if>>
		<<else>>
			The spectacled hookah <<hookah_master>> sits on a stool and sips from a teacup.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $daily.hookah is 1>>
			<<He>> looks at you. "I'm afraid we don't allow someone to spend more than an hour a day on the hookah," <<he>> says. "For your safety."
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> looks at you. "<<printprice 5000>> for an hour on the hookah."
			<br><br>
		<</if>>

		<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(5000) and $daily.hookah is undefined>>
			<<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[Smoke (1:00)|Flats Hookah Smoke]]>><<set $daily.hookah to 1>><<money -5000>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<getouticon>> <<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Hookah Smoke
<<effects>><<wearProp "hookah pipe">>

You sit on a cushion in front of the hookah pipe, put the hose to your mouth, and inhale.
<br><br>

You find yourself on your back beneath a ceiling that will not stay still. A dark crack spreads across the plaster, widening until the ceiling seems to open above you.
<br><br>

<<if $awareness gte 400>>
	The sight makes your thoughts scatter, <span class="green">but you keep enough control to remember where you really are.</span> Through the opening, an alien forest stretches beneath the sky. Colossal tentacles move above the trees.
	<br><br>
	<<if $settings.tentaclesEnabled>>
		<<link [[Enter|Tentacle Forest Entrance]]>><<set $tentacleEntrance to "hookah">><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You're terrified by them,</span> and start pushing against your consciousness, trying to force yourself to wake up. However, for one brief moment of lucidity, <span class="lewd">you wonder what would happen if you opened your mind to it.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Try to enter|Tentacle Forest Enable]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 1>> | <span class="pink">This will enable tentacles.</span> <!-- Appears even with blind stats enabled. Intentional -->
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Ignore|Flats Hookah Flow]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<willpower 6>><<if $awareness lt 600>><<awareness 6>><</if>><</link>><<ggwillpower>><<if $awareness lt 600>><<ggawareness>><</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You try to focus on the room, <span class="red">but the vision keeps replacing it before you can get your bearings.</span><<ggwillpower>><<willpower 6>><<if $awareness lt 600>><<ggawareness>><<awareness 6>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Flow]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Flats Hookah Flow
<<effects>>

Images replace one another too quickly to follow. You see unfamiliar landscapes, hear voices you cannot understand, then feel yourself falling despite the cushion beneath you. Each sensation disappears before you can work out what it meant.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<loadNPC 0 "hookah">><<person1>>
<<if $hookah_state gte 2>>
	The visions keep changing until you wake on a cushion in the hookah parlour. You stay down until the floor looks steady, then push yourself upright and get to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The visions keep changing until you wake on a cushion in the hookah parlour. You blink at the room until you recognise it again. "Thank you for your custom," the <<hookah_master>> says. "I fear we only allow an hour per day. Safety reasons."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> helps you to your feet, and leads you to the door.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Flats Hookah End
<<location "flats">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>

<<storeon "hookah">>

<<if $hookah_state gte 2>>
	You awaken in the hookah parlour. You wait for the spinning to subside, then rise to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "hookah">><<person1>>
	You awaken in the hookah parlour. "Thank you for your custom," the <<hookah_master>> says. A wry smile forms on <<his>> lips. "A good trip, I take it?"
	<br><br>

	<<if $rng gte 81>>
		"It's best you don't stay there too long," <<he>> says, helping you to your feet. "It's a mistake few make more than once."
	<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
		"Don't tell the others," <<he>> says, helping you to your feet. "They'll tell you that's not the point of the hookah, but they'd be jealous."
	<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
		"I'd go straight home if I were you," <<he>> says, helping you to your feet. "A trip often leaves one sensitive."
	<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
		"Don't fret if you see anything unusual in the next hour or so," <<he>> says, helping you to your feet. "The effects can linger."
	<<else>>
		"Let me take a look outside before you leave," <<he>> says, helping you to your feet. "Just to make sure there are no ruffians around."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> pushes <<his>> spectacles up the bridge of <<his>> nose, and walks you to the door.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Flats Hookah Clean
<<effects>>

You sweep the larger pieces of glass into a dustpan, then vacuum the floor until the smaller shards are gone. Several cushions and pieces of furniture are beyond saving, so you drag them into the corridor one at a time.
<br><br>
Once the floor is clear, you kneel beside the hookah. The vase is shattered, but the stem and hose are still intact.
<br><br>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<generate2>>
A shoe scrapes against the floor behind you. You turn and find <span class="pink">Bailey</span> leaning against the doorframe, with one of <<his>> goons, a <<person2>><<person>>, standing beside <<person1>><<him>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Clean 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Clean 2
<<effects>>

Bailey looks over the cleaned room before turning back to you. "I take a <span class="pink">50%</span> cut," <<he>> says. "That isn't negotiable." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin at the <<person2>><<person>>, who disappears into the corridor outside.
<br><br>

<<link [[Nod|Flats Hookah Clean Nod]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Get angry|Flats Hookah Clean Angry]]>><<def 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Clean Nod
<<effects>>

You nod, though Bailey has already taken your agreement for granted. "You'll need a new hookah. I can't help with... whatever it was the old master put in that thing. <i>Try the farms outside town.</i> Someone might have snared what you need."
<br><br>

The <<person>> returns, carrying an intact hookah pipe. <<He>> brings it into the middle of the room.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Clean End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Clean Angry
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
	"But you take so much already," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please, Bailey. You already take so much," you say.
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
	"Surely your usual cut is enough already," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"You already get plenty from me," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Like hell you need more," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Like I don't pay you enough already," you say.
<<else>>
	"But I already pay you," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"That's one thing," Bailey sneers. "This is another. You'll need a new hookah. I can't help with whatever it was the old master put in them. <i>Try the farms outside town.</i> Someone might have snared what you need."
<br><br>

The <<person>> returns, carrying an intact hookah pipe. <<He>> brings it into the middle of the room.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Clean End]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Flats Hookah Clean End
<<effects>>

Bailey steps aside to let <<person1>><<his>> goon pass with the hookah, then checks the room once more.
<br><br>
<<He>> looks at you and gives a short nod before leaving.<<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<glove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Juice Carried
<<effects>>

You fetch a pair of tongs from the kitchen and pin the lurker before it can wriggle out of your net. It twists between the metal jaws while you carry it to the hookah and lower it inside.
<br><br>

A sweet-smelling incense fills the air.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Juice Fridge
<<effects>>

You fetch a pair of tongs from the kitchen and open one of the cages in the fridge. The lurker snaps and twists when you catch it, but you keep hold long enough to carry it to the hookah and lower it inside.
<br><br>

A sweet-smelling incense fills the air.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Fridge
<<effects>>

You open the fridge and unlatch one of the interior cages. Holding your net beneath it, you tip the cage until the creature drops inside, then slam the little door shut before anything else can escape.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Smoke Danger
<<effects>><<wearProp "hookah pipe">>

You sit on a cushion in front of the hookah pipe, put the hose to your mouth, and inhale.
<br><br>

You find yourself on your back beneath a ceiling that will not stay still. A dark crack spreads across the plaster, widening until the ceiling seems to open above you.
<br><br>

<span class="red">Your stomach drops.</span> The room disappears, and you are dragged through one changing corridor after another before you can brace yourself.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Smoke Danger 2]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Hookah Smoke Danger 2
<<effects>>

You awaken behind a dumpster. <span class="pink">Your clothes are missing.</span> You're somewhere in town, and there's no one else around, but you keep your body covered as you rise to your feet.
<br><br>

<<clothesruined>>
<<switch $rng>>
<<case 1>>
	<<set $bus to "nightingale">>
<<case 2>>
	<<set $bus to "domus">>
<<case 3>>
	<<set $bus to "elk">>
<<case 4>>
	<<set $bus to "high">>
<<case 5>>
	<<set $bus to "starfish">>
<<case 6>>
	<<set $bus to "barb">>
<<case 7>>
	<<set $bus to "connudatus">>
<<case 8>>
	<<set $bus to "wolf">>
<<case 9>>
	<<set $bus to "harvest">>
<<case 10>>
	<<set $bus to "oxford">>
<<case 11>>
	<<set $bus to "danube">>
<<case 12>>
	<<set $bus to "mer">>
<<case 13>>
	<<set $bus to "cliff">>
<</switch>>
<<destination>>


:: Flats Hookah Work
<<effects>>

You open the front door, letting the sweet incense leak outside. You won't need to wait long. How do you want to present yourself?
<br><br>

<<link [[Friendly|Flats Hookah Work Friendly]]>><</link>><<note "Troublesome anomalies" "blue">>
<br>
<<link [[Professional|Flats Hookah Work Professional]]>><</link>><<note "Troublesome customers" "blue">>
<br>



:: Flats Hookah Work Professional
<<effects>>

You wait by the door.
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "hookah_work_professional_1" 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>A <<person>> walks right by you, and looks around.
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say, a little quietly. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say gently. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say with practised courtesy. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say with easy assurance. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say flatly. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say dryly. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<<else>>
		"Welcome to the hookah parlour," you say. <<He>> jumps when <<he>> hears your voice. "It's £50 for an hour on the hookah."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you say, hurrying to answer before <<he>> can finish. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you say gently, cutting in before the question can settle. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you say, stepping in before the question can fully form. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you say smoothly. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you say, not bothering to hide your impatience. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you cut in. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<<else>>
		<<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak. "No two people have the same experience," you interrupt, as if predicting a question. "I'm afraid the substance itself must remain a secret."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pays you, and sits on a cushion. You've made <<income 2500 "flatsHookah">>.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Flats Hookah Work Professional Grope]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<br>
<</addinlineevent>>

